{"name":"-68-S-4","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_2023Slow_Keyboard_Correct","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The latest report has been transmitted. Please enter the keycode to unlock the report."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Keycode Question... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If Hell were now called \"Heaven\", how would the departed souls tell it and the real Heaven apart?"}],"choices":["A. They would not be able to.","B. They would not be able to.","C. They would not be able to."]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.3","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_2","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"687","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.2","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AR-18. Hailing AR-18.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I miss you. I miss the Elmo. I want to go home.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I finally understand everything. I've met my past and future \"self\".","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I don't want to become those versions of \"me\". I want to be Erma. I want to be true to myself.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It took me so long to finally find a place where I belong; I don't want to lose it just like that!","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Getting out of here is proving a bit difficult, but I don't think it's impossible. I WILL come back.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When I'm back, I'll brag all about what I've done to the Commander and ask for a reward. You'd better back me up.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Tell the Commander how much I've been through to secure the bargaining chip that would be the key to their rescue...","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Promise, okay?!","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.4","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
